{"t":"Ladder","s":"ladder-a9e50","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Ladder_Wood_595926.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"notice metadata\" id=\"w-disambig\"><i>This is a Disambiguation page — a navigational aid which lists other pages that might otherwise share the same title. If an article link referred you here, you might want to go back and fix it to point directly to the intended page.</i></div>\n<p><b>Ladders</b> are stationary items that serve as a means of ascending or descending between different floors or levels. To ascend, interact with the area at the base of the ladder where it meets the ground. To descend, simply walk onto the ladder's hole. Most ladders in the game have a similar appearance and come in various materials, including:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ladder (Wood)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ladder_Wood_595926.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ladder (Bamboo)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ladder_Bamboo_6c9c97.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rope-Ladder\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rope_Ladder_267c52.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ladder%20%28Oramond%29\"><img alt=\"Ladder (Oramond)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ladder_Oramond_8f7245.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</p><p>Though they are rare there are trap door ladders, that you may only go down (Like some holes in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">maze of lost souls</a>), but not up, even by using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">rope</a>. You can tell these ladders from regular ones, because the ladder on the trap door ladder looks \"sawed off\" and you see only a small (unusable) ladder segment.\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p>Ladders, Stacking, and Elevation</p></div></div>","quests":["oramond-quest","rapier-quest","the-cursed-crystal-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"oramond-quest","quest":"Oramond Quest","step":"4-0","n":37,"title":"Chegar ao Zeronex","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33616,"y":31990,"z":6,"label":"Escada para o Zeronex"}]},{"slug":"rapier-quest","quest":"Rapier Quest","step":"0-1","n":2,"title":"Descer a escada","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"rapier-quest","quest":"Rapier Quest","step":"0-4","n":5,"title":"Sair dos esgotos","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32094,"y":32204,"z":7,"label":"Entrada/saída dos esgotos"}]},{"slug":"the-cursed-crystal-quest","quest":"The Cursed Crystal Quest","step":"5-4","n":23,"title":"Subir até à One-Eyed Joe","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32026,"y":32886,"z":6,"label":"One-Eyed Joe"}]}]}}